  "name": "antfarm",
  "description": "A hybrid simulation framework integrating a Java-based Processing 4 cellular automata engine with a Unity 3D visualization layer via a RESTful HTTP synchronization bridge. The system implements complex pheromone-driven agent behaviors using weighted random walks and path-reversal heuristics, while the Unity frontend enables immersive gestural interaction through Ultraleap hand-tracking modules. This architecture facilitates real-time state serialization and remote action execution between decoupled simulation and rendering runtimes.",
